      "value": "@{5bc7bc299b16a652226e8366|full_name}: im a small creator but ive been seeing people i think are cool constantly following me. \nMost of the time its great.. b sometimes i want to be able to explore public worlds without being followed.  The only way to stop friends is to remove them.  Itd just be convenient if you could set your status to busy when you want to do something alone.",
